        <mxCell id="R7YbY3Kf2T4tzzcuFcL3-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;nextjs&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;A react framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Gives,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;routing&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;server rendering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;API routes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Image optimization&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Everything that I need to know to make my website rank higher in SEO.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; style=&quot;margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Next.js gives your React application a structural foundation. Instead of building your own backend server, router, and optimization pipeline, Next.js provides it out of the box.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95 NOp1Jf&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 12px 0px 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Routing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt; Automatically creates routes based on your folder structure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Rendering Options:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt; Allows you to choose between Server-Side Rendering (SSR), Static Site Generation (SSG), and Client-Side Rendering (CSR) per page.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Performance:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt; Automatically optimizes images, scripts, and fonts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Full-Stack Capabilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt; Includes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;H23r4e&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; href=&quot;https://medium.com/@ancilartech/stop-overusing-redux-how-next-js-server-actions-simplify-server-backed-state-71d892521623&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(26, 13, 171); border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(26, 13, 171);&quot;&gt;Server Actions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yADgie&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt; and API routes to handle database queries directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="490" width="740" x="50" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="R7YbY3Kf2T4tzzcuFcL3-3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;RFC&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Request for comments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Request for Comments (RFC):&lt;/span&gt; This is a formal proposal intended to &lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;gather feedback and open a discussion&lt;/span&gt; with the developer community before implementing a major new feature or architectural shift. The repository you linked explicitly titles itself as the &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;H23r4e&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/reactjs/rfcs&quot; aria-label=&quot;React RFC Process. Link preview. Site: GitHub. Title: reactjs/rfcs: RFCs for changes to React · GitHub. URL: https://github.com/reactjs/rfcs.&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; text-decoration: underline 1px rgb(21, 88, 214); border-bottom: 0px rgb(21, 88, 214);&quot;&gt;React RFC Process&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; to collaborate on engineering designs.&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://legacy.reactjs.org/blog/2017/12/07/introducing-the-react-rfc-process.html&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Docmaps-Project/rfcs&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="180" x="870" y="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
